# === Public framework / private content boundary =============================
# NEVER commit a user's runtime overlay: real journal profiles, exemplar PDFs,
# project profiles, or the captured-stat ledger. This is enforced twice — here
# and by scripts/lint_no_journal_content.py in CI.
.neuro-audit/
**/exemplars/
run-ledger.jsonl
*.pdf

# === Python ==================================================================
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/

# === OS / editor =============================================================
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
